<title>CANADA: Falconbridge Q3 shr net rises after gain.</title>
<headline>Falconbridge Q3 shr net rises after gain.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.50		   C$0.47</p>
<p> Net			 88,700		   84,600</p>
<p> Revs		     496,100		  565,400</p>
<p>	   9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$1.24		   C$1.43</p>
<p> Net			220,100		  253,400</p>
<p> Revs		   1,642,900		1,754,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 176,900		  176,600</p>
<p>		(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Falconbridge Ltd. In the third quarter of 1996, the C$101.5 million payable by Diamond Fields Resources under the merger offer delivery agreement was recorded as well as a dilution gain of C$36.1 million from the issue of shares by Collahuasi.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416-941-8100</p>
